37	/**
38	 * Remove `//` and slash-star comments while preserving string and template
39	 * literals verbatim (a `"https://…"` is not a comment, and neither is the `//`
40	 * inside `/^https?:\/\//`). Replaces each comment with a single space so token
41	 * boundaries survive.
42	 */
